23:| 1 | NHES.S1 | Partly. This is the one that moved | 2007 asks students to understand health concepts. 2024 asks them to use health information that is practical enough to act on. The shift is from knowing to using. |
24:| 2 | NHES.S2 | Yes | 2007 lists the kinds of influence by name (family, peers, culture, media, technology and others). 2024 drops the list and speaks of influences in general. |
